# Optimizer Tests

## Files

These are standalone LLVM IR test files for the optimizer passes. They were
captured from earlier compiler experiments and are not generated by the
current command-line compiler.

Files without an `_opt` suffix are unoptimized inputs. Files with an `_opt`
suffix or an `.expected.ll` suffix are expected optimized outputs.

## Coverage

The test files exercise local constant folding, common-subexpression
elimination, and global constant propagation.
